{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS00773-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS00814-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DVS00845-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC06619-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>{'translation': '兩間獨立書店「留下書舍」及「田園書屋」於前日（15日）遭國安警察上門搜查並拘捕。據了解，留下書舍有3人、田園書屋有2人被捕，涉嫌違反《基本法》第二十三條下的煽動罪。', 'replaced': False}</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/DSC06465-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>{'translation': '政府新聞公報指，警方國家安全部接獲海關轉介後展開調查，於旺角兩間書店拘捕5人，涉嫌違反《維護國家安全條例》第24條，即「具煽動意圖並作出具煽動意圖的行為」罪，並檢獲一批書籍。', 'replaced': False}</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T03:18:53.326758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":6,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}